        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A substantial quest chain and three movement trials, with no random reward roll.\n\n1. Use a Horde character and enable Trivial Quests. Start Azshara Blues with Teemo near 59.4,50.5 in Bilgewater Harbor and meet Kalec near 55.5,52.1. On a character that already started this story, resume its first unfinished quest instead of restarting the zone.\n\n2. Follow Friends Come In All Colors to Ergll at 70.4,36.2. Complete his errands, including A Little Pick-me-up, Absorbent, Full of Hot Water and That's Just Rude! Follow the offered order. Full of Hot Water uses the boiling-water elemental near the Tower of Eldara; do not skip the automatically offered quest.\n\n3. Take Wash Out to Sorata Firespinner at the Northern Rocketway Exchange near 42.6,25.2, then Dressed to Impress. Continue to the apprentice camp and Image of Archmage Xylem near 47.2,20.8. The Way to a Mage's Heart is obsolete and is not a missing prerequisite.\n\n4. Complete the apprentice tasks Shear Will, Waste of Thyme, Renewable Resource, Manual Labor and Trouble Under Foot. Then follow The Pinnacle of Learning and Watch Your Step to the trial area. Use the quest's transport and arcane stepping route rather than searching below the cliff for the NPC.\n\n5. At Xylem's trial hub near 55.8,12.0, complete The Trial of Fire, The Trial of Frost and The Trial of Shadow. Fire: move into safe runes for 10 consecutive bursts. Frost: collect 20 ice essences while avoiding Frostburn. Shadow: lure 20 Weeping Souls across shadow runes without letting them touch you. Use the colored crystals and portals to reach the arenas; follow the quest counters.\n\n6. Finish Xylem's Asylum and Wasn't It Obvious?, then the Spirit of Azuregos quests Easy is Boring and Turning the Tables. Follow the story to Kalec, Feno and Jellix in the Bitter Reaches, completing Fade to Black, Pro-liberation and Ice Cold as offered.\n\n7. Speak to Azuregos near 67.0,20.4 for Farewell, Minnow, then deliver it to Sorata Firespinner in Bilgewater Harbor near 53.2,50.0. Receive Faded Wizard Hat and use it from your bags to add it to the Toy Box.",
