        name = "Tol Barad Searchlight",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Honored reputation and daily-quest currency take several visits; the final purchase is guaranteed.\n\n1. Use the Tol Barad portal in your faction capital's Cataclysm portal area to reach Tol Barad Peninsula, map 245. The peninsula daily hub is separate from the southern battle island and the Baradin Hold raid.\n\n2. Alliance: take dailies at Baradin Base Camp near 73,61. Horde: take them at Hellscream's Grasp near 55,80. Complete and turn in the offered peninsula quests for reputation and Tol Barad Commendations. Repeat after daily resets until this character is Honored and has at least 40 commendations.\n\n3. If your faction controls the southern battle island, its available daily quests can add more reputation and currency. This is optional: ownership is not required for the peninsula dailies or the toy purchase.\n\n4. Alliance: buy Tol Barad Searchlight (63141) from Quartermaster Brazie near 72.4,63.0. Horde: buy Tol Barad Searchlight (64997) from Pogg near 54.6,81.0. Both vendors are on Tol Barad Peninsula. Pay 40 commendations; the old Toy Box tooltip suggesting a gold-only purchase is misleading.\n\n5. Use your purchased searchlight to learn it. Check both Toy Box versions before spending more currency: the matching opposing-faction toy is granted with the first unlock, so a second character does not need to repeat the grind.",
