        itemId = 64373,
        name = "Chalice of the Mountain Kings",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The survey-and-solve route is simple, but project discovery can take repeated Dwarf solves.\n\n1. Learn Archaeology from Harrison Jones at 85.6,25.8 in Stormwind, or Belloc Brightblade at 49.0,70.6 in Orgrimmar. Enable dig-site tracking on the world map and learn Survey. This is a secondary profession and does not replace a primary profession.\n\n2. Work active Dwarf dig sites in Eastern Kingdoms, where this race is common. Check the fragment type on each find and clear other active sites when necessary to generate new Dwarf locations.\n\n3. At each active dig site, use Survey, follow the instrument's direction and narrow the distance as its light changes from red through yellow to green. Loot the finds until the site is exhausted. In the Archaeology journal, solve the current Dwarf artifact to roll the next project. Continue until Chalice of the Mountain Kings appears; neither a specific dig nor a fixed solve count guarantees this rare.\n\n4. Optional fragment supply at Archaeology 600: crate completed common artifacts from Pandaria, Draenor or the Broken Isles into Restored Artifacts. Visit Brann Bronzebeard at 83.5,31.0 in the Seat of Knowledge, on the balcony above Mogu'shan Palace in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Exchange 1 Restored Artifact for a crate of Dwarf fragments and open it. Ordinary old Dwarf solves are not themselves Restored Artifacts.\n\n5. When Chalice of the Mountain Kings is your current Dwarf project, collect 100 Dwarf Archaeology Fragments, or insert up to 3 Dwarf Rune Stones into its sockets. Each socket replaces 12 fragments; all three reduce the requirement to 64 fragments. Click Solve to receive the toy.\n\n6. Use the completed Chalice of the Mountain Kings from your bags to add it to the account-wide Toy Box. The finished toy does not require Archaeology to use. This is a Dwarf project, so focus Eastern Kingdoms instead of the much more common Night Elf sites in Kalimdor.",
        sourceType = "Professions",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=64373",
