        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Modern Timbermaw quests and repeatable turn-ins give large reputation gains; there is no rare drop or daily lockout.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and visit Nafien at the southern Timbermaw tunnel entrance in northern Felwood, 64.0,10.4. Complete the Timbermaw quests he offers against Deadwood furbolgs. Keep Deadwood Headdress Feathers instead of selling them.\n\n2. Follow the Timbermaw quests inside the tunnel and on the Winterspring side. Gorn One Eye is near 64.6,5.0 on the Felwood map; Salfa is near 21.0,46.2 in Winterspring. Complete their offered Deadwood/Winterfall tasks and keep Winterfall Spirit Beads.\n\n3. Turn in sets of 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers to Nafien and 5 Winterfall Spirit Beads to Salfa once their repeatable quests are available. Kill more of the corresponding hostile furbolgs for missing turn-in items. Repeat until Exalted; old pre-Cataclysm accounts of tiny reputation gains overstate the current grind.\n\n4. Enter Timbermaw Hold and find Meilosh near 64.8,5.2 on the Felwood map. Buy Stave of Fur and Claw once this character is Exalted; the toy can be hidden from his inventory before then. Pay the displayed price, normally 60 gold with the required reputation discount.\n\n5. Use the stave from your bags to learn the Toy Box item. Its use remains tied to Timbermaw reputation, so an alt without the standing may see the learned toy but cannot necessarily activate it.",
