        name = "Kalytha's Haunted Locket",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Travel to one vendor and pay the gold price; there is no random drop or progression unlock.\n\n1. Bring 5,000 gold on a character that can reach Azshara. Either faction can buy the locket; you do not need to complete the Faded Wizard Hat story first.\n\n2. Fly to Bear's Head around 25.5,38.0 in Azshara, northeast of Gallywix Pleasure Palace. Look for the elevated tower and enter its lower occupied floor. This is not the apprentice camp or the trial island farther north.\n\n3. Speak to Tex Vortacoil inside the tower and buy Kalytha's Haunted Locket for the displayed price, listed at 5,000 gold. Check the toy's name before buying reagent supplies from the same vendor.\n\n4. Use the locket from your bags to add it to the account-wide Toy Box. If Tex is missing while you have an active quest or scenario in this tower, finish or leave that phase and return, or buy it on another character without that phasing conflict.",
