        name = "Burgy Blackheart's Handsome Hat",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Reaching the wreck is simple with Vashj'ir access, but finding the rare alive and receiving the hat can take repeated visits.\n\n1. Travel to Vashj'ir and its Shimmering Expanse subzone. If this character has never been there, use the capital's Vashj'ir introduction when available and complete the opening Sea Legs quests for underwater breathing and movement, then continue far enough to obtain the zone seahorse.\n\n2. Swim or ride to Burgy's underwater wreck around 57.6,69.8 on the Shimmering Expanse map. Descend to the ship on the seabed; looking at the surface above the coordinate will not reveal the rare.\n\n3. Look for Burgy Blackheart (50052), the ghostly gnome pirate by the wreck. Kill him and loot the corpse for Burgy Blackheart's Handsome Hat (134022). If other collectors are waiting, group up before the kill and let nearby players reach the wreck.\n\n4. If Burgy is absent, return later or wait for a respawn. If he drops no hat for you, try another eligible kill. Old comments disagree about loot rules and sometimes call it guaranteed; a single anecdote is not a reliable current drop guarantee.\n\n5. Use the hat from your bags to learn it. If you already have the original physical hat (65665) from Cataclysm, check that old character and the Toy Box before farming another copy.",
