        itemId = 133998,
        name = "Rainbow Generator",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A compact sequence of ordinary quests in southern Felwood, without daily or random-drop gates.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and visit Arcanist Delaris at 41.8,72.0 in southern Felwood. If starting on a fresh character, complete The Corruption of the Jadefire when offered, killing the required Jadefire Glen satyrs. Then take Do the Imp-Possible.\n\n2. For Do the Imp-Possible, weaken Impsy in Jadefire Glen and use the Enchanted Imp Sack supplied by the quest. Return to Delaris. The captured Impsy then appears at the camp and offers the follow-ups.\n\n3. Complete See the Invisible by collecting 8 Cursed Ooze from the Ruins of Constellas, around 39.8,71.6. Then do Touch the Untouchable: use the quest's Phaseblood Potion at the Sigil of Tichondrius in Jadefire Glen, around 42.2,79.8. Kill Vorlus and loot the Claw of Tichondrius in that phased area, then return to camp.\n\n4. Complete Break the Unbreakable by killing Xavathras around 33.6,65.6, then return for Open Their Eyes. Use Delaris's Prism on 20 Jadefire Imps around 41.6,78.0 in Jadefire Glen; the objective is to terrify the imps with the prism, not kill them.\n\n5. Turn Open Their Eyes in to Arcanist Delaris at 41.8,72.0 and receive Rainbow Generator (133998). Use it to learn the toy. If Impsy is invisible after his capture, leave and return to the camp or relog before assuming the chain has been removed.",
